<p>When you use your Resilience of the Dwarves racial power your skin becomes so tough that it even absorbs damage from non-physical attacks.</p><p>Non-physical damage is reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">60%, 77%, 87%, 94%, 100%</acronym> of your total armour value (ignoring hardiness).</p><p>While this effect is not active, half of it is still applied against foes entangled by your stone vines.</p><p>For Drems this effect activates as long as the hungering mouth summoned by From Below It Devours is alive.</p>